{{short description|None}}
{{GeoGroup}} This list is of the '''[[Monuments of Japan|Historic Sites of Japan]]''' located within the {{ill|Prefectures of Japan|en|Prefectures of Japan|qid=Q50337|lt=Prefecture|1=Prefectures of Japan}} of '''{{ill|Nagasaki Prefecture|en|Nagasaki Prefecture|qid=Q169376|lt=Nagasaki|1=Nagasaki Prefecture}}'''.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.bunka.go.jp/tokei_hakusho_shuppan/shuppanbutsu/bunkazai_pamphlet/pamphlet_en.html |title=Cultural Properties for Future Generations |publisher=[[Agency for Cultural Affairs]] |access-date=24 June 2024}}</ref>
==National Historic Sites== As of 24 June 2024, thirty-two Sites have been {{ill|Cultural Property (Japan)|en|Cultural Property (Japan)|qid=Q858308|lt=designated|1=Cultural Property (Japan)}} as being of national {{ill|Values (heritage)|en|Values (heritage)|qid=Q7912786|lt=significance|1=Values (heritage)}} (including three *{{ill|List of Special Places of Scenic Beauty, Special Historic Sites and Special Natural Monuments|en|List of Special Places of Scenic Beauty, Special Historic Sites and Special Natural Monuments|qid=Q20982902|lt=Special Historic Sites|1=List of Special Places of Scenic Beauty, Special Historic Sites and Special Natural Monuments}}).<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.bunka.go.jp/seisaku/bunkazai/shokai/shitei.html |script-title=ja:史跡名勝天然記念物 |trans-title=Number of Monuments of Japan by Prefecture |language=Japanese |publisher=[[Agency for Cultural Affairs]] |date=1 June 2024 |access-date=24 June 2024}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |url=https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/bsys/index |title=Database of National Cultural Properties: 史跡名勝天然記念物 (史跡, 特別史跡 長崎県 2県以上) |language=Japanese |publisher=[[Agency for Cultural Affairs]] |access-date=24 June 2024}}</ref>
